Supplemental budgets-limitations. 25LSO-0437, 1.0
FISCAL NOTE
No significant fiscal or personnel impact.
The State Budget Office indicates that proposed legislation will not impact the
cost of the Supplemental Budget. The restrictions provided within this proposed
legislation are typically what drive supplemental budget requests.
